Dear Mr. Mayor and Members of City Council,
My name is Brian Bau and
I am representing ARCHCO A’bany, LLC. We are experienced Restaurateurs
and we have owned and operated the Village Inn restaurant in Cheyenne since August of 2016. We love
being a part of the Cheyenne community and are excited for the opportunity to grow with Cheyenne in
the acquisition of The Albany. I have been in the restaurant industry for 23 years and we are looking
forward to building on the great legacy The Albany and the Kallas family have established in the
community over the last 79+ years.
Sincerely,
Brian C. Bau
Manager
